{"sections":[{"slug":"双单纯集","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"双单纯集"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">双单纯集</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“双单纯集”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">双单纯集是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯集","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯集</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯对象</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">也即函子</span> $\\Delta^{\\text{op}}\\times\\Delta^{\\text{op}} \\to\\mathsf {Set}$. <span lang=\"zh\">双单纯集又称单纯空间</span> (simplicial space).</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">双单纯集的范畴记为</span> $\\mathsf {ssSet}$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n"}]}}}]}